	<section_number>64.2-773</section_number>
	<catch_line>Enforcement and defense of claims</catch_line>
	<text>
		A trustee shall take reasonable steps to enforce claims of the trust and to defend claims against the trust.
	</text>
	<history>2005, c. 935, § 55-548.11; 2012, c. 614.</history>
</law>
